&lt;p&gt;&amp;rarr; F - 1 = E&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rarr; G - 2 = E&lt;/p&gt;
Hence, &amp;ldquo;CCEE&amp;rdquo; is related letters.&amp;nbsp;

