&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Given:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;48k2048p6 is divisible by 99&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concept used:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If the sum of digits of the number is divisible by 9, then the number itself is divisible by 9.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If the difference of the sum of alternative digits of a number is divisible by 11 or 0, then that number is divisible by 11 completely.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;99 = 9&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 11&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, the number should be divisible by both 9 and 11&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4 + 8 + k + 2 + 0 + 4 + 8 + p + 6 = 32 + k + p&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Possible values of k + p = 4, 13&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Again,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(4 + k + 0 + 8 + 6) - (8 + 2 + 4 + p) = 0 or multiple of 11&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 18 + k - 14 - p = 0 or multiple of 11&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 4 + k - p = 0 or multiple of 11&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;k - p can be - 4 or 7&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For k + p = 4 and k - p = - 4&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We can say by adding both 2k = 0&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; k = 0&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, p = 4&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;[Both are possible]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Again,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;For k + p = 4 and k - p = 7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;We can say by adding both 2k = 11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; k = 5.5&amp;nbsp; [Not possible]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Again,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;For k + p = 13 and k - p = - 4&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;We can say by adding both 2k = 9&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; k = 4.5&amp;nbsp; [Not possible]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Again,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;For k + p = 13 and k - p = 7&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;We can say by adding both 2k = 20&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; k = 10&amp;nbsp; [Not possible]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;So, only possible values of k and p is 0 and 4&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Now,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;k&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; p = 0&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 4&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; 0&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;there4; Required answer is 0.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

