	&lt;li&gt;Let&amp;#39;s take a look at the phrase: &amp;#39;&amp;#39;school&amp;#39;&amp;#39; as a distinct domain from &amp;quot;home&amp;quot; where their own----------(5) ought to hold sway.&lt;/li&gt;
